<title>USA: E.W. Scripps August revenues $89.2 mln.</title>
<headline>E.W. Scripps August revenues $89.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>E.W. Scripps Co said Wednesday its consolidated revenues rose 8.5 percent in August to 89.2 million, compared to $82.2 million in August 1995.</p>
<p>The company said newspaper advertising revenues for the month were $40.8 million, up 8.2 percent, and total newspaper revenue moved up 6.7 percent to $$55.7 million.</p>
